BT 1 0 0 1 56 516.8898 Tm (calendar at the start of each quarter. Working from another country for more than 10 days in a year) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 56 501.8898 Tm (needs written approval from the managing partner.) Tj T* ET
